Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":false,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":4,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":true,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":467,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1908099,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":285111,"Name":"katja10","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-285111.jpg?_r=1449277165","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1449175079,"LastPoster":{"Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":14,"Preview":{"Id":1908099,"PostDate":1449175079,"PostContent":"Hello Brides!! \u00a0 My fianc\u00e9 and I are getting married at the Grand Palladium Vallarta Resort & Spa...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"katja_t@live.com","IpAddress":"216.18.90.185","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1445093522,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-285111.jpg?_r=1449277165","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"katja10","Id":285111,"Name":"katja10","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.151.250.95","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79779,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"55c687f0942169ccd7d4aeb331f69786","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hello Brides!!\n\n&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;My fianc\u00e9 and I are getting married at the Grand Palladium Vallarta Resort &amp;amp; Spa in November 2016! We have put down deposits and have a couple of decisions left to make for now. I was hoping for some input from others who have had a wedding here, attended one, or any advice in general about destination weddings would OF COURSE be super helpful :)&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Right now we are trying to decide on whether to have a private dinner or stick with the \"semi-private\" option that is included in the wedding package. I&#039;m wondering if any of you have input on either option, and whether it&#039;s worth it to pay the extra fee for the private.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;If you have had your wedding here, and did the semi-private, any input as to what that was like would be wonderful! I&#039;m just not sure what to expect!!\n\n&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thanks in advance, and i look forward to hearing from you all!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1908099,"PostDate":1449175079,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello Brides!!<br>\n\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My fianc\u00e9 and I are getting married at the Grand Palladium Vallarta Resort & Spa in November 2016! We have put down deposits and have a couple of decisions left to make for now. I was hoping for some input from others who have had a wedding here, attended one, or any advice in general about destination weddings would OF COURSE be super helpful <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Right now we are trying to decide on whether to have a private dinner or stick with the \"semi-private\" option that is included in the wedding package. I'm wondering if any of you have input on either option, and whether it's worth it to pay the extra fee for the private.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>If you have had your wedding here, and did the semi-private, any input as to what that was like would be wonderful! I'm just not sure what to expect!!<br>\n\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks in advance, and i look forward to hearing from you all!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"katja_t@live.com","IpAddress":"216.18.90.185","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1445093522,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-285111.jpg?_r=1449277165","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"katja10","Id":285111,"Name":"katja10","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"179.53.131.194","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79779,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by Moments That Matter, 06 December 2015 - 12:50 PM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1449406251,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1e77da1913b52bff086df8408f0a0309","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Congrats on your upcoming Grand Palladium Vallarta wedding, katja10 and welcome to our forum community!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;You&#039;ve come to the right place for lots of great info, advice, suggestions and support from everyone here, so well done on getting a great start :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;For some added inspiration, here are a few Grand Palladium wedding moments that matter we captured in our magnificent Mayan Riviera.....enjoy!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;From the &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10153293696454487.1073741929.18683524486&amp;amp;type=3&#039;&gt;Grand Palladium Colonial Wedding Album:&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-atl3-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xtp1\/t31.0-8\/11216626_10153293698119487_9190968238500906742_o.jpg\" alt=\"11216626_10153293698119487_9190968238500\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-atl3-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xfa1\/v\/t1.0-9\/11165242_10153293699394487_2674173710963234126_n.jpg?oh=4301bc0fc08798a26f0eda04de99b7da&amp;amp;oe=56D821AD\" alt=\"11165242_10153293699394487_2674173710963\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-atl3-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xap1\/t31.0-8\/1529734_10153293700009487_6903874213755181251_o.jpg\" alt=\"1529734_10153293700009487_69038742137551\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Wishing you happy research and all the hope you find the perfect answers for you - cheers!!! team MTM :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1908148,"PostDate":1449406187,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Congrats on your upcoming Grand Palladium Vallarta wedding, katja10 and welcome to our forum community!!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>You've come to the right place for lots of great info, advice, suggestions and support from everyone here, so well done on getting a great start <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>For some added inspiration, here are a few Grand Palladium wedding moments that matter we captured in our magnificent Mayan Riviera.....enjoy!!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>From the <a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10153293696454487.1073741929.18683524486&type=3' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Grand Palladium Colonial Wedding Album:<\/a><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-atl3-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xtp1\/t31.0-8\/11216626_10153293698119487_9190968238500906742_o.jpg\" alt=\"11216626_10153293698119487_9190968238500\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-atl3-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xfa1\/v\/t1.0-9\/11165242_10153293699394487_2674173710963234126_n.jpg?oh=4301bc0fc08798a26f0eda04de99b7da&oe=56D821AD\" alt=\"11165242_10153293699394487_2674173710963\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-atl3-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xap1\/t31.0-8\/1529734_10153293700009487_6903874213755181251_o.jpg\" alt=\"1529734_10153293700009487_69038742137551\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wishing you happy research and all the hope you find the perfect answers for you - cheers!!! team MTM <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i711.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww116\/momentsthatmatter\/MTMLogo08-1.png\" alt=\"MTMLogo08-1.png\"><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography Studios, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving Mayan Riviera<br>\nEmail: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/4212-beautiful-november-wedding\/#review'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280192660,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.90.222.99","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79779,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1adbcda876fc531e86cdb2266a401b94","RawContent":"Welcome and congrats!\n\nIf you use the search bar up top you may find threads for your specific resort too :) may help answer some questions while you wait for replies!\n\n\nThis resort was on my list but in the end we chose the Mayan. I know of people who&#039;ve stayed there and really loved it :)\n\n\nGood luck!\n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1908156,"PostDate":1449431565,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Welcome and congrats!<br>\nIf you use the search bar up top you may find threads for your specific resort too <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> may help answer some questions while you wait for replies!<br><br>\nThis resort was on my list but in the end we chose the Mayan. I know of people who've stayed there and really loved it <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br><br>\nGood luck!<br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399410602,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.50.15.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79779,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a4ab08854eddf3e8e1089f46783961b5","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Congrats and welcome!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I agree with calgarybride2015. I would do a search up top and see what forums come up for the resort you&#039;re looking at, as well as the \"Resort Reviews\" section and see what past brides have said about their experience.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Good luck!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1908175,"PostDate":1449498094,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Congrats and welcome!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I agree with calgarybride2015. I would do a search up top and see what forums come up for the resort you're looking at, as well as the \"Resort Reviews\" section and see what past brides have said about their experience.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Good luck!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><em>I said \"yes\" again to the love of my life at Grand Coral Beach Club, Playa del Carmen, Mexico on our 4th anniversary - October 20, 2015<\/em><\/span>","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283440999,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"79779","Title":"Grand Palladium Vallarta - Tips Please!","LastPostDate":1449498094},"Pages":{"TotalItems":4,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
